# User's credentials — never commit.
#
# Secrets (API token + build password) live in per-scope *.pkrvars.hcl files at
# the packer/ root, NOT auto-loaded: they are supplied explicitly per build with
# `-var-file` (see README.md). Because they are not auto-loaded, a build pulls
# exactly the secret for its target and can never inherit another target's.
#
#   cluster.pkrvars.hcl   -> pve01-03 cluster token + build password
#   pve04.pkrvars.hcl     -> pve04 token + build password
#
# The committed vars/pveXX.pkrvars.hcl files hold LAYOUT ONLY (no secrets).
*.pkrvars.hcl

# Keep the committed layout files tracked (they match the rule above).
!vars/*.pkrvars.hcl

# Keep the committable example template tracked (its .example suffix would match).
!*.pkrvars.hcl.example

# Packer plugin binaries + build artifacts
.packer/
.packer_cache/
override/
*.log
